name: sim.handleSimulationScripts
description: Lua only. Calls a specific system callback function in simulation scripts. Simulation scripts will be executed in a precise order. This function should only be called from the main script.
pythonSynopsis: int scriptCount = sim.handleSimulationScripts(int callType)
inputs:
1. callType: the desired system call type (e.g. sysCall_actuation)
outputs:
1. scriptCount: number of called simulation scripts
replacedBy:
- name: handleSimulationScripts, class: scene, file: scene_handleSimulationScripts.method
